        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prime building site extending to approximately 0.30 acres, ideally positioned along the Boyle Road on the outskirts of Frenchpark village. The property is situated in a highly sought-after and convenient location, within easy reach of local shops, schools and amenities. \nThe site benefits from excellent road connectivity, with convenient access to the newly opened N5 Frenchpark Bypass. Boyle, Castlerea, Carrick on Shannon and Ireland West Airport Knock, which is approximately 25 minutes away, are also readily accessible.\nOffering an excellent opportunity to construct a home in an attractive location, the site may be sold as it stands or subject to planning permission.\nFor further details contact the office on 090-6663700 or email info@dngivanconnaughton.ie"
      },
